--[[
        TURN AROUND -- a blue ghost, like Halt, comes at you from one end of the room, then from the other

            loadstring(game:HttpGet("https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bonellocristian78-lab/Gradish-Mode/claude/sei-qui-con-noi-ye4k62/TurnAround"))()

        Everything goes blue and foggy, a cold hum. At one end of your room a glowing blue ghost (arms out, its tail
        fading into the floor, sparks of light around it) floats toward you: walk away from it. Then "TURN AROUND": it is
        gone, and coming at you from the other end, so you turn and walk the other way. Again and again (7 times, a
        little faster every time). Touched: 40 damage (at your last health, your death) and it is on the other side
        again. Then it fades, and the colours come back.

        Only you see it. Run it again: a new one (the one before goes). Outside DOORS: along where you look.
]]

